> Actual generated pen-coordinate trajectories

Coordinates accumulate the saved generated offsets. Lines show temporal order, including moves across pen-up events. File names retain the historical source names; this reconstruction trains only digit IDs0..9 in the21-symbol model. An out-of-training prompt ID is a control, not evidence of learned letter synthesis.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/handwriting_paths.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){auto load=[](const std::string&path){auto a=dm::nn::load_npz(path);return std::map<std::string,dm::nn::Tensor>(a.begin(),a.end());};auto layout=dm::graphics::RLayout::create(1,3);for(auto file:{"sample_ab.npz","sample_ba.npz","sample_op.npz"}){auto a=load("build/nn-completion/models/handwriting/"+std::string(file));auto stroke=a.at("strokes").to_vector<double>();std::vector<double>x{0},y{0};for(size_t t=0;t+2<stroke.size();t+=3){x.push_back(x.back()+stroke[t]);y.push_back(y.back()+stroke[t+1]);}auto plot=dm::graphics::RPlot::create();plot.lines(x,y,"generated offset path",{37,99,235}).points(x,y,"sampled steps",{37,99,235},2).x_label("Cumulative source dx").y_label("Cumulative source dy").title(file);layout.add(plot);}layout.size(1400,500).fit_panels().save_svg("build/handwriting_paths.svg");}
